// H9a acceptance area (a) — prompt-mode sentinel turn.
// One prompt-mode untyped query drives a single user-visible turn through the
// real `pi -p` binary. Invariant set: no-error exit + emitted codes subset of
// the committed permitted-code list.
//
// Drive discriminators are ANSWERS to task questions over the theta's own
// computed text -- deterministic content a degraded plain-prompt run cannot
// produce. A verbatim-echo demand ("reply with exactly this") reads as prompt
// injection to current models and draws refusals: the sentinel-refusal class
// filed as bug 0243.
@`What is 482 plus 315? Answer with the number only.`
